    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7cce57f1_7dbb3ba8",
        "filename": "manager/1.0/IServiceManager.hal",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 26,
      "author": {
        "id": 1120458
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-10-21T16:19:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I did this because these methods shouldn\u0027t be called directly by anything outside of hidl. For get/check service, Interface::getService should be used. For register service, service-\u003eregisterAsService should be used. For something like \u0027listServices\u0027, a literal call like:\n\nauto sm \u003d IServiceManager::getService(\"manager\");\nsm-\u003elistServices(...);\n\ncould be made. However, one would never say:\n\nsm-\u003egetService(...);\n\nexcept for the calls made internally by Interface::getService.\n\nWant me to remove it?",
      "parentUuid": "5cba7338_52c2b2ec",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 26,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 26,
        "endChar": 28
      },
      "revId": "e5595adb2354e2a3f8ff4466e57e883b59acd61f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "41260cae_161f3c83",
        "filename": "manager/1.0/IServiceManager.hal",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 26,
      "author": {
        "id": 1013030
      },
      "writtenOn": "2016-10-24T14:52:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It just clutters the code a bit. But I think this points at a bigger issue - currently the IServiceManager service (hwservicemanager) only exists on a binderized device. In that case I don\u0027t think we want client code to make direct references to IServiceManager at all; unless we make IServiceManager \u0027generic\u0027 and not binder-specific.\n\nThe question then is: what do the IServiceManager calls do if you\u0027re a client using passthrough? This is also very relevant to the camera usecase.",
      "parentUuid": "7cce57f1_7dbb3ba8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 26,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 26,
        "endChar": 28
      },
      "revId": "e5595adb2354e2a3f8ff4466e57e883b59acd61f",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
